@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@
+From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
+Subject: [PATCH] debian/control: mark the build tools :native for cross builds
+
+scripts/build-media-debs.sh cross-builds mesa (amd64 build, arm64 host).
+Ubuntu's Build-Depends carry no :native annotations, so apt resolves the
+build tools (python3-mako, rustc, bindgen, meson, ...) for arm64 and fails.
+Mark the tools that run on the build machine :native and add the host's
+Rust standard library (libstd-rust-dev) for rusticl/NVK. No change for a
+native build: :native is the build architecture there.
+
+Generated-by: LLM
